                    <li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>@T("ဝယ်ယူမှု မှတ်တမ်းတင်ပါ", "Record the purchase")</h3><p>@T("ဝယ်ယူသည့် ပမာဏ ထည့်ပါ။", "Enter the bill amount. Stamps are calculated for you.")</p></div></li>
